# LibreHU: Android 11 and later (LineageOS 18.1, 19.1, 20). Applied by the CI after ac8257_a10.config, whose settings
# it keeps (no xt_qtaguid, PSI, no in-kernel low memory killer). The two settings below break Android 9 / 10:
#  - RT_GROUP_SCHED off (Android 11+ kernel configs), required on by Android 9 / 10; ANDROID_DEFAULT_SETTING selects it
#    unless LIBREHU_ANDROID_11_PLUS;
#  - binderfs: the binder misc devices are no longer created, Android 11+ init mounts binderfs and links
#    /dev/binder, /dev/hwbinder and /dev/vndbinder to it; Android 9 / 10 init does not.
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-a11"
CONFIG_LIBREHU_ANDROID_11_PLUS=y
# CONFIG_RT_GROUP_SCHED is not set
CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDERFS=y
